<article class="dewu-case">
  <header class="dewu-hero">
    <a class="case-back" href="<%- url_for('/#projects') %>">← 返回项目</a>
    <div class="dewu-cover-heading">
      <div class="dewu-cover-title"><span class="dewu-mark"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/dewu-logo.png') %>" alt="得物"></span><i></i><h1>3D 数字资产升级</h1></div>
      <div class="dewu-cover-sub"><i></i><b>自动化生产流程迭代</b><i></i></div>
      <div class="dewu-cover-tags"><span># 3D/AR</span><span># AI自动化</span><span># 技术升级</span><span># 流程优化</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dewu-stage">
      <div class="stage-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="poizon-logo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="dewu-phone-ui"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/phone-ui.png') %>" alt="得物 3D 空间手机界面"></div>
      <div class="shoe-carousel" id="shoeCarousel" aria-label="五双鞋循环展示，点击左右鞋款切换">
        <% [4,3,1,2,5].forEach(function(n){ %><button class="carousel-shoe" data-shoe="<%= n %>" type="button" aria-label="选择鞋<%= String(n).padStart(2,'0') %>"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/shoe-0' + n + '.png') %>" alt="鞋<%= String(n).padStart(2,'0') %>"></button><% }) %>
      </div>
      <div class="dewu-cover-slogan"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/dewu-sport-mark.png') %>" alt="得到运动"></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="dewu-context"><div class="dewu-section-index">01 / 项目背景与目标</div><div class="context-layout"><article class="context-background"><span>PROJECT BACKGROUND</span><h2>从“看见商品”，<br>走向“真实感知”。</h2><p>随着运动鞋高客单价商品在线交易规模增长，用户仍主要依靠静态图片和视频完成购买决策。既有 3D Mesh 虽能提供空间预览，但生产流程缓慢，难以规模化覆盖更多鞋类商品。</p><div class="context-signals"><div><b>商品还原不足</b><small>细节与材质感知有限</small></div><div><b>缺乏穿戴感知</b><small>无法建立真实体验预期</small></div><div><b>转化效率放缓</b><small>内容体验难以支撑增长</small></div><div><b>购买决策偏弱</b><small>用户判断成本依然较高</small></div></div></article><aside class="context-goals"><span>PROJECT GOALS</span><h3>以体验升级，连接三重价值。</h3><div class="goal-stack"><article><strong>01</strong><div><b>用户价值</b><p>增强真实感知<br>降低决策成本</p></div></article><article><strong>02</strong><div><b>业务价值</b><p>提升用户互动<br>促进交易转化</p></div></article><article><strong>03</strong><div><b>品牌价值</b><p>提升品质感知<br>强化平台心智</p></div></article></div></aside></div></section>

  <section class="dewu-overview"><div class="dewu-section-index">02 / 项目挑战</div><div class="dewu-copy-grid"><h2>规模化增长下，传统生产链路成为瓶颈。</h2><div><p>问题不只发生在建模环节，而是贯穿采集、制作、验收和上线：大量人工操作让效率、品质与规模难以同时成立。</p><p>项目需要重新定义一条稳定、可复制、可持续扩展的 3D 数字资产生产链路。</p></div></div><div class="dewu-problem-flow"><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-01.png') %>" alt="手动采集项目挑战"><span>01</span><b>采集效率低</b><p>依赖人工逐角度拍摄，单品耗时长</p></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-02.png') %>" alt="人工建模项目挑战"><span>02</span><b>制作成本高</b><p>建模步骤繁琐，修改返工频繁</p></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-03.png') %>" alt="品质验收项目挑战"><span>03</span><b>品质不稳定</b><p>验收标准分散，结果一致性不足</p></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-04.png') %>" alt="上线项目挑战"><span>04</span><b>难以规模上线</b><p>生产周期过长，无法快速覆盖 SKU</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="dewu-role"><div class="dewu-section-index">02 / 我的职责</div><div class="dewu-copy-grid role-heading"><h2>从设计判断，<br>到生产落地。</h2><div class="role-intro"><b>负责的不是单点制作，而是整条生产链路。</b><p>以商品展示体验为起点，推进需求定义、技术验证、流程设计与质量验收，并协同产品、硬件、算法、开发和外部制作团队。</p></div></div><div class="role-board"><aside class="role-profile"><span>PROJECT ROLE</span><h3>3D 设计负责人</h3><p>负责把设计目标转译为可执行的技术方案、生产流程与验收标准，持续平衡展示效果、生产效率和规模化质量。</p><div class="role-scope"><span>需求定义</span><span>技术验证</span><span>流程设计</span><span>质量标准</span><span>跨团队推进</span></div></aside><div class="role-workstreams"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>业务与体验定义</h3><p>从用户浏览和商品展示场景出发，明确 3D 资产的体验价值、生产目标与项目优先级。</p></div><b>需求方案</b></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>采集设备与技术验证</h3><p>参与自动化采集设备研发与 3DGS 方案验证，持续评估素材质量、建模效果和生产可行性。</p></div><b>验证结论</b></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>生产流程与系统协同</h3><p>梳理采集、建模、验收、上线的完整链路，协同开发搭建生产与管理工具，减少重复人工操作。</p></div><b>流程方案</b></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>规范建立与品质验收</h3><p>制定鞋类资产制作规范和验收口径，对齐内部与外部团队，保证批量生产结果稳定一致。</p></div><b>生产规范</b></article></div></div><div class="role-collaboration"><span>协作链路</span><div><b>产品</b><i>需求与价值</i></div><em>→</em><div><b>硬件</b><i>采集设备</i></div><em>→</em><div><b>算法</b><i>技术方案</i></div><em>→</em><div><b>开发</b><i>生产系统</i></div><em>→</em><div><b>外部团队</b><i>批量制作</i></div></div></section>

  <section class="dewu-pipeline"><div class="dewu-section-index">03 / 流程重构</div><div class="dewu-copy-grid"><h2>自动化重构生产流程。</h2><p>把重复劳动交给自动化，让设计聚焦质量与体验。</p><div class="pipeline-switch" role="group" aria-label="流程对比"><button class="active" data-pipeline="after">升级后</button><button data-pipeline="before">升级前</button></div></div><div class="pipeline-board">
    <div class="pipeline-mode active" data-mode="after"><div class="pipeline-summary"><strong>80%</strong><span>采集效率提升</span></div><div class="pipeline-steps image-steps"><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/automation-01.png') %>" alt="自动化采集"><span>01</span><b>自动化采集</b><small>效率提升80%</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/automation-02.png') %>" alt="自动化建模"><span>02</span><b>自动化建模</b><small>可大批量稳定生产</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/automation-03.png') %>" alt="品质验收"><span>03</span><b>品质验收</b><small>管理后台统一验收标准</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/automation-04.png') %>" alt="上线"><span>04</span><b>上线</b><small>实现规模化生产</small></article></div></div>
    <div class="pipeline-mode" data-mode="before"><div class="pipeline-summary before-summary"><strong>传统流程</strong><span>大量人工参与</span></div><div class="pipeline-steps image-steps before-steps"><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-01.png') %>" alt="手动采集"><span>01</span><b>手动采集</b><small>手动拍摄采集数据效率低</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-02.png') %>" alt="人工建模"><span>02</span><b>人工建模</b><small>步骤繁琐易出错返工</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-03.png') %>" alt="品质验收"><span>03</span><b>品质验收</b><small>品质有高低，影响上线成功率</small></article><em>→</em><article><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/challenge-04.png') %>" alt="上线"><span>04</span><b>上线</b><small>周期长难规模化</small></article></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="dewu-system"><div class="dewu-section-index">04 / AI 效率驱动</div><div class="system-heading"><h2><span>AI</span> 效率驱动，<br>重构生产链路。</h2><div class="system-context"><p>通过 Claude Code、Cursor 辅助自动化工具开发与后台原型设计，把重复处理交给程序，让团队把时间集中在质量判断和体验优化上。</p><div class="ai-tool-stack"><span>AI 编程协作</span><b>Claude Code</b><b>Cursor</b></div></div></div><div class="ai-system-grid"><article class="ai-system-card"><header><strong>01</strong><div><h3>采集数据批处理</h3><p>角度、命名、品质等合规检测</p></div></header><div class="ai-system-visual"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/ai-data-processing.png') %>" alt="采集数据 AI 自动化处理界面"></div><footer><p>将批量导入、智能检测、自动处理和结果输出串成连续流程，减少人工逐张检查与重复操作。</p><span>节省人工检查时间</span></footer></article><article class="ai-system-card"><header><strong>02</strong><div><h3>流程链路原型设计</h3><p>数据流转、增删改查、统计与验收</p></div></header><div class="ai-system-visual"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/backend-review-platform.png') %>" alt="3D 资产后端验收平台"></div><footer><p>基于真实生产链路设计后台原型，协同产品和开发统一任务状态、验收口径与资产管理方式。</p><span>提升跨团队协作效率</span></footer></article></div></section>

  <section class="dewu-quality"><div class="quality-intro"><div class="dewu-section-index">05 / 品质与体验</div><div class="dewu-copy-grid"><h2>技术升级，最终回到真实的商品体验。</h2><p>通过新旧模型对比、材质细节检查和多品类测试，验证自动化结果能否达到商业展示要求。</p></div></div><div class="quality-compare-screen"><div class="compare-module"><figure class="compare-side"><div class="quality-phone quality-before"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/quality-before-3dmesh.png') %>" alt="升级前 3D Mesh 商品浏览效果"><figcaption><span>BEFORE / 优化前</span><b>3D MESH</b></figcaption><div class="quality-hover-note"><i></i><span>塑料感</span></div></div></figure><div class="compare-handle"><i></i><span>VS</span></div><figure class="compare-side after"><div class="quality-phone quality-after"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/quality-after-3dgs.png') %>" alt="升级后 3DGS 商品浏览效果"><figcaption><span>AFTER / 优化后</span><b>3DGS</b></figcaption><div class="quality-hover-note"><i></i><span>更加真实</span></div></div></figure></div></div></section>

