    <div class="browse-sticky">
      <div class="browse-scene scene-figures" data-scene="figures" data-reaction="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/reaction-heart.png') %>"><img class="browse-background" src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/browse-figures.png') %>" alt="手办 3D 浏览效果"><div class="browse-copy"><span>FROM SHOES TO COLLECTIBLES</span><h2>从鞋履到潮玩，<br>3D 浏览延展更多品类。</h2><p>细节可以被放大、旋转和比较，真实质感也收获了用户持续好评。</p></div><div class="browse-comments"><article class="browse-comment tone-orange left" style="--x:30%;--delay:.3s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-xilanhua.png') %>" alt="羞羞西蓝花"><div><b>羞羞西蓝花</b><p>第一次在手机里看到这么逼真的 3D 手办模型</p></div></article><article class="browse-comment tone-pink right" style="--x:57%;--delay:2.8s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-laofuzi.png') %>" alt="潮玩老夫子"><div><b>潮玩老夫子</b><p>效果好棒，甚至可以看到反光！</p></div></article><article class="browse-comment tone-green left" style="--x:25%;--delay:5.3s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-wangzi.png') %>" alt="wangzifight6"><div><b>wangzifight6</b><p>有一种所见即所得的感觉，质感很好</p></div></article></div></div>
      <div class="browse-scene scene-shoes" data-scene="shoes" data-reaction="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/reaction-like.png') %>"><img class="browse-background" src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/browse-shoes.png') %>" alt="鞋类 3D 浏览效果"><div class="browse-copy"><span>06 / 上线体验</span><h2>3D 商品浏览，<br>真正走向用户。</h2><p>鞋类 3D 空间上线后，用户可以在手机中自由查看商品，也留下了真实而积极的评价。</p></div><div class="browse-comments"><article class="browse-comment tone-orange left" style="--x:31%;--delay:.1s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-huya.png') %>" alt="虎牙丫"><div><b>虎牙丫</b><p>效果好棒，感觉直接在手机上就可以逛实体店啦</p></div></article><article class="browse-comment tone-purple right" style="--x:57%;--delay:2s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-mowang.png') %>" alt="魔王兔叽"><div><b>魔王兔叽</b><p>模型比之前更逼真，效果更好了 👍</p></div></article><article class="browse-comment tone-cyan left" style="--x:25%;--delay:4s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-heijin.png') %>" alt="鬼畜小黑金"><div><b>鬼畜小黑金</b><p>到货实物和 3D 模型看到的效果几乎一样</p></div></article><article class="browse-comment tone-silver left" style="--x:33%;--delay:6s"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/dewu/avatar-xixi.png') %>" alt="乘风破防小西西"><div><b>乘风破防小西西</b><p>可以全方位查看鞋子，真不错</p></div></article></div></div>
